### 1. Cadastrar Cliente com Sucesso (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Tech Solutions LTDA",
  "email": "contato@tech.com",
  "documentNumber": "12345678000199",
  "creditLimit": 5000.00
}

### 2. Cadastrar Cliente com Falha de Validação (400 Bad Request / Problem Details)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "name": "Jo",
  "email": "invalido",
  "documentNumber": "123",
  "creditLimit": -100.00
}

### 3. Consultar Cliente por ID (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clientes/42
Accept: application/json

### 4. Consultar Cliente Inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clientes/999
Accept: application/json

### 5. Consulta Multi-Fonte com X-Tenant-ID (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clientes?status=ATIVO&limite=10
X-Tenant-ID: tenant_filial_sp
Accept: application/json

### 6. Inativação de Cliente (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/clientes/42
